  "Body": {
    "ContentType": "html",
    "Content": "<p>The following new features have been added in public preview in December 2021:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n\t<li><a href=\"https://docs.microsoft.com/azure/azure-netapp-files/snapshots-restore-file-single\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Single-file snapshot restore</a></li>\r\n\t<li><a href=\"https://docs.microsoft.com/azure/azure-netapp-files/convert-nfsv3-nfsv41\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">NFS protocol version conversion</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Feature regional coverage continues to expand as well for&nbsp;<a href=\"https://docs.microsoft.com/azure/azure-netapp-files/azure-netapp-files-network-topologies#supported-regions\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">standard network features</a>:&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n\t<li>South Central US</li>\r\n\t<li>West US 3</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n",
    "Markdown": "The following new features have been added in public preview in December 2021:\n\nSingle-file snapshot restore\n\nNFS protocol version conversion\n\nFeature regional coverage continues to expand as well for standard network features :\n\nSouth Central US\n\nWest US 3"
  },
